    of "Astrazma Urania" once per turn. If this card is Special Summoned: You can
    reveal any number of monsters in your hand with different Levels, then target
    that many face-up cards your opponent controls; negate their effects. If this
    card on the field is destroyed by card effect and sent to the GY: You can add
    this card to your hand.'
